   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "I like",
     "texto": [
      "It translates as «to like», but the verb agrees with the thing liked, so watch the agreement: **mi piace** + singular noun (**Mi piace il caffè**) and **mi piacciono** + plural noun (**Mi piacciono i biscotti**).",
      "With other people the pronoun changes: **ti piace** (you like), **Le piace** (you like, formal).",
      "Negative: **Non mi piace**. To emphasise: **Mi piace molto** (I really like) and **Mi piace moltissimo** (I love it)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Likes",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Italiano",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
